# Optional config for scripts/gen-docs-*.sh. Copy this file (along with
# the script(s) you want) into any repo as .gen-docs.conf, no edits needed:
# with everything commented out like this, both settings fall through to
# auto-detection, which covers the common case (docs at the repo root,
# a normal origin/HEAD default branch). Uncomment and edit only the lines
# you actually need to override.

# Base branch to diff against when no [base-branch] argument is given.
# Default: auto-detected from the remote's origin/HEAD, falling back to
# origin/main if that isn't set.
# base_branch=origin/main

# Where docs live, relative to the repo root.
# Default: docs
# docs_dir=docs
